---
<section class="section" id="objectives">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">02 · Strategic Objectives</span>
      <h2>Four anchors guiding everything we build.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="cards cards-4">
      <article class="card">
        <div class="num">01 / Time</div>
        <h3>Reclaiming Scientist Time</h3>
        <p>
          Scientists often spend large portions of time on manual effort. AKD reduces
          friction in repetitive discovery, search, synthesis, and workflow tasks so
          scientists can focus on hypothesis generation, interpretation, and analysis.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <div class="num">02 / Orchestration</div>
        <h3>Cross-Disciplinary Orchestration</h3>
        <p>
          AKD connects information across data repositories, scientific literature,
          code repositories, workflows, and domain tools — instead of forcing
          scientists to work across siloed systems.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <div class="num">03 / Infrastructure</div>
        <h3>Uniform Infrastructure Integration</h3>
        <p>
          Common design patterns, SDK components, agent interfaces, guardrails, and
          deployment pathways support AI agents across NASA science systems and
          partner platforms.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <div class="num">04 / Trust</div>
        <h3>Scientific Integrity &amp; Trust</h3>
        <p>
          Transparency, reproducibility, open science, human-in-the-loop oversight,
          and science-specific guardrails are first-class design constraints — not
          afterthoughts.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cards {
    display: grid;
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .cards-4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }

  .card {
    position: relative;
    padding: 28px 26px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--surface), var(--bg-1));
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    transition: border-color .2s ease, transform .2s ease;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .card:hover { border-color: var(--border-strong); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .card::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(92,210,230,0.5), transparent);
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity .25s ease;
  }
  .card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
  .card .num {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .card h3 { margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .card p { font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.6; }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .cards-4 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .cards-4 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
